                        <td><strong>A mass gainer</strong><br><small>(actually bulking)</small></td>
                        <td><strong>Dymatize Super Mass Gainer</strong><br><small>Our #2 safest &mdash; 25% of the Prop 65 limit</small></td>
                        <td>25% of limit</td>
                        <td><a href="https://amzn.to/3Wl18B2" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="table-buy-btn">Buy&nbsp;→</a></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="safe-row">
                        <td><strong>Clean-label gainer</strong></td>
                        <td><strong>Transparent Labs Mass Gainer</strong><br><small>Informed Choice certified</small></td>
                        <td>87% of limit</td>
                        <td><a href="https://amzn.to/49hvX0U" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="table-buy-btn">Buy&nbsp;→</a></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr class="safe-row">
                        <td><strong>Everyday protein</strong><br><small>(most people)</small></td>
                        <td><strong>ON Gold Standard</strong><br><small>Consumer Reports #5 &mdash; ~$0.75/serving</small></td>
                        <td>Below detection</td>
                        <td><a href="https://amzn.to/4hpjiuZ" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="table-buy-btn">Buy&nbsp;→</a></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:13px; color:#6b4a1a;">
